      "annotationExplanation": "古代传说中善兴云作雨的神"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 14,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-14-17",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "荒东北隅中，有山名曰凶犁土丘。应龙处南极，杀蚩尤与夸父，不得复上"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 17,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-17-13",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "足也，将走大泽，未至，死于此。应龙乃已杀蚩尤，又杀夸父，乃去南方"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "entryId": "chuci-03-02",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "方九则,\n\n何以坟之？\n\n河海应龙,\n\n何尽何历？\n\n鲧何所营？"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-05-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "生庶鸟，凡羽者生于庶鸟。毛犊生应龙，应龙生建马，建马生麒麟，麒麟"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 7,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-07-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "后世，光晖重万物。乘雷车，服驾应龙，骖青虬，援绝瑞，席萝图，黄云"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 10,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-10-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "山，形性诡也。夫螣蛇游雾而动，应龙乘云而举，猨得木而捷，鱼得水而"
    }
  ],
  "firstSeen": {
    "bookId": "shanhaijing",
    "chapterIndex": 14
  }
}
